    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "主路径",
      "items": [
        "Browser → Nest:3008 → Middleware → SsrController → PageRenderService → StreamStrategy → RendererLoader → pipeDocument",
        "structx：ALL /* → SsrController.page → renderDocument → matchPage / execute",
        "本仓库没有 Repository / 数据库；AssetService 与 RendererLoader 是文件与 bundle 适配器"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "鉴权门",
      "items": [
        "RequestContextMiddleware 把 x-demo-role 写入 Locals.renderAuth",
        "SpaPathGuard 硬编码 /about 需要 about:read；PageAccessGuard 读 PAGE_ROUTES.access（当前为空）",
        "拒绝时 PageRenderService 直接 403，不再调用 Strategy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "前端链路",
      "items": [
        "hooks/ 目录为空；页面订阅在 stores 的细粒度 selector",
        "HomePage → SsrMetaToolbar / SsrMetaPanel → useSsrPageJson",
